# What a Vercel deploy from this folder leaves behind. Unlike git, it keeps
# the built assets (public/build) and the image derivatives (public/assets/**/
# _derived and the manifest): Vercel serves them as they are, and cannot
# build the derivatives itself (no GD in its PHP runtime).
/.git
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
/node_modules
/vendor
storage/logs
storage/framework/cache
storage/framework/sessions
storage/framework/views
storage/pail
database/*.sqlite
/tests
.phpunit.result.cache
/.claude
/.ai
/.idea
/.vscode
CLAUDE.md
AUDIT.md
public/hot
public/storage
